{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>Behold.</b> This is the third verse, and the matter is on account of <span class=\"he\">ילד עומת</span> [begetting opposite], which parallels <span class=\"he\">שבא כנגד שבא</span> [coming opposite coming]: I have seen that there is nothing good for a man who occupies himself to gather wealth, only that he eat and rejoice."], :book :ecclesiastes, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Wikisource" "https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%90%D7%91%D7%9F_%D7%A2%D7%96%D7%A8%D7%90_%D7%A2%D7%9C_%D7%A7%D7%94%D7%9C%D7%AA"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:27:48.924711782Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}